WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.030
You've seen this painting before,
in Room One.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.530
Cropsey's Autumn on the Hudson River
is here again on purpose,

3
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.370
so look at it
with this room's question in mind.

4
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:14.210
The village, the bridge, the boats,
the people resting by the pond:

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.350
these are signs of a peaceful,
owned, farmed countryside.

6
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.350
It is the happy after picture,
the future the settler paintings promise.

7
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.610
And again, no Native people appear in it.
